        "id": "calc-deriv-003b-h2",
        "type": "hint",
        "dependencies": ["calc-deriv-003b-h1"],
        "title": "Divide by h and Factor",
        "text": "$\\frac{f(x+h) - f(x)}{h} = \\frac{4xh + 2h^2 + 3h}{h}$\n\nFactor out $h$:\n\n$= \\frac{h(4x + 2h + 3)}{h} = 4x + 2h + 3$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "https://www.siyavula.com/read/za/mathematics/grade-12/differential-calculus",
